## Skills globales de gentle-ai

SDD skills live in your home, NOT in the project. When you need
sdd-propose, sdd-tasks, sdd-apply, tdd-protocol or sdd-archive, look for them here:

~/.codeium/windsurf/skills/sdd-propose/SKILL.md
~/.codeium/windsurf/skills/sdd-tasks/SKILL.md
~/.codeium/windsurf/skills/sdd-apply/SKILL.md
~/.codeium/windsurf/skills/tdd-protocol/SKILL.md
~/.codeium/windsurf/skills/sdd-archive/SKILL.md

If you do not find them there, use find or glob to search for **/sdd-propose/SKILL.md
in your home. Do NOT search in the project directory.

